  <item>
    <title>V.7 闲话巴黎：蜗牛与松弛感，影展与卢浮宫</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6757cf1e17cd5416ade0228f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6757cf1e17cd5416ade0228f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Dec 2024 05:24:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期内容导览</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> 开场</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">0:20</a> 个人介绍</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">1:18</a> &nbsp;蜗牛与松弛感</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 铁塔、教堂与花园，每天2万步</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1907">31:47</a> 巴黎影展与“四签名”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2813">46:53</a> 半天时间，卢浮宫看什么？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3593">59:53</a> 后记：如果再去一次巴黎</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>必要的文字：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于我 </span></strong><span>A.K.A. 李白兔子</span></p><span></span><p><span>摄影师，编辑，自媒体人，摄影笔记讲师。订阅号“一点OnePoint”创始人。中国摄影家协会会员。</span></p><span></span><p><span>《手机摄影笔记》作者，《手机摄影：从小白到大师（实战篇）》联合作者。</span></p><span></span><p><span>IPPA 2015、2017、2018、2021、2022、2023、2024获奖人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>北京大学客座讲师，国家地理&amp;vivo“影像寻城记”大使。《GQ智族》2015年手机摄影专题受访摄影师，《摄影之友》2019年度榜中榜年度影像人物。</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果、三星、vivo、OPPO、小米、htc、LG等手机品牌合作摄影师；佳能、哈苏、索尼、Profoto、适马等影像品牌合作摄影师。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>蜗牛与松弛感</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>省流：蜗牛好吃，松弛感很好，共享单车很贵……</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>铁塔、教堂与花园，每天2万步</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>圣心大教堂，地铁2号线Anvers站出来往北走（往北看也能看到尖顶）。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fju65-cLclyz15pI3Wta4eQGLYFr.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>杜乐丽花园，傍晚时分的旋转木马。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpahvkGwq0sHB6HMyfQWrQ9sfjXB.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>很近的一堆好地方：</span></p><span></span><p><span>大皇宫 - 亚历山大三世桥 - 协和广场 - 杜乐丽花园 - 橘园美术馆 - 卢浮宫 - 对岸的奥塞美术馆 - 巴黎歌剧院也不太远</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ls_zpfbHWgFnMPrNKw_gBpugPQoD.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FojNdCvr0ogBFtc2EG_Z5rT8wy-Z.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lippVNI3yKTkDG6k3s0wowQu6nG5.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>步行桥：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lne8MKBrLUJZJpvwXPOCADacfskX.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>爱桥（很多街头艺人，记得带零钱打赏哈）：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lg0LcKFszFAOLt_TFCiMes4G6vv0.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>航班靠北坐，可能遇到极光。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhMhiIUP1K8LNx2M9CHN2JrLhPEl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>巴黎影展与 “四签名”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>全程巴黎国际摄影艺术展（Paris Photo）。看不懂正常，有的我也看不懂。感受，而非理解。可以先记录下来作品+作者，然后回来慢慢搜索学习。</span></p><span></span><p><span>比较容易懂的，萨尔加多、杉本博司、桑德（下图里那一整面墙就是桑德的作品墙）。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvZENUteJWBtomDFZBPmfhJkRv07.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>大皇宫外会有分会场，可能有大师在签售书籍，感兴趣的不妨一看：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhlO7bvqA5C6N-bYugpvTSm7eNOO.HEIC"></figure><span></span><p><span>马丁·帕尔</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrxO8oX5HMVm7Xr1rABdFrpjdzat.HEIC"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>半天时间，卢浮宫看什么？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>两河展区的精品很多，但给我印象最深的不是神兽的石雕，也不是国王猎狮的浮雕，而是一幅描绘发掘古巴比伦文明发掘现场的油画——旷野草原下，是被黄土流沙覆盖的城门。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llC-1U_c6fMDMiKktv8qwnbTf9vz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>不禁让我想起当初看《异形·契约》时，生化人大卫吟诵雪莱的那首诗《奥兹曼迪亚斯》：</span></p><span></span><p><span>I met a traveller from an antique land,</span></p><span></span><p><span>Who said: Two vast and trunkless legs of stone</span></p><span></span><p><span>Stand in the desert. Near them, on the sand,</span></p><span></span><p><span>Half sunk, a shattered visage lies, whose frown,</span></p><span></span><p><span>And wrinkled lip, and sneer of cold command,</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tell that its sculptor well those passions read</span></p><span></span><p><span>Which yet survive, stamped on these lifeless things,</span></p><span></span><p><span>The hand that mocked them and the heart that fed;</span></p><span></span><p><span>And on the pedestal these words appear:</span></p><span></span><p><span>"My name is Ozymandias, king of kings,</span></p><span></span><p><span>Look on my works, ye Mighty, and despair!"</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nothing beside remains. Round the decay</span></p><span></span><p><span>Of that colossal Wreck, boundless and bare</span></p><span></span><p><span>The lone and level sands stretch far away.</span></p><span></span><p><span>（以下为我翻译的版本）</span></p><span></span><p><span>我遇到一位来自遥远古国的旅人，</span></p><span></span><p><span>他对我言说：</span></p><span></span><p><span>“曾见一双巨腿矗立在荒漠之中，</span></p><span></span><p><span>由巨石雕成，却无躯体。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一旁沙中，半露着一张破碎的石脸，</span></p><span></span><p><span>他紧锁眉头，嘴角翘起，威严地冲我冷笑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>工匠的技术精湛，在无生命的石上，</span></p><span></span><p><span>刻下永存的神识与情绪。</span></p><span></span><p><span>以手抚之，以心感之，</span></p><span></span><p><span>才发觉石像的基座，隐隐刻有一行文字：</span></p><span></span><p><span>“吾乃奥兹曼迪亚斯，万王之王！</span></p><span></span><p><span>见吾功绩，任尔大能，亦要屈膝拜服！”</span></p><span></span><p><span>除此以外，再无他物。</span></p><span></span><p><span>缓缓风化，那巨大的断壁残垣。</span></p><span></span><p><span>难寻边际，满目萧然，</span></p><span></span><p><span>只有黄沙漫漫，绵延向远方。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnkHTY7yQZqlqZF6ZXP3D0c5EQJB.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>5</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>后记：如果再去一次巴黎</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>两三天的卢浮宫，晴天的橘园美术馆。然后去法国更多地方走一走。</span></p><span></span><p><span>放松下来，找个咖啡馆或者烘焙店，好好感受下慢节奏的法式松弛。</span></p><span></span><p><span>至于大皇宫里会挂几幅我的作品（这次是2+3），我觉得都 OK 啦~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjUHjMm6kisKOHOL8PF8Sr8Ih3eW.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>关于 未来你将会听到的内容</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>单反相机过时了吗？（剪辑中）</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为摄影师，我怕AI抢饭碗吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>到底哪款手机拍照好？</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么一次旅行可以让我的审美提升巨大？</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还想听到什么？欢迎在评论里告诉我~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于 你还能在哪找到我</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微信订阅号：一点OnePoint</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：摄影师李白兔子</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：李白兔子</span></p>]]></description>
